<title>SINGAPORE: Hotel Grand Central 1996 net down 47 pct.</title>
<headline>Hotel Grand Central 1996 net down 47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				5.87 vs  11.10</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		    4.00 vs   4.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     3.20 vs   6.05</p>
<p>    Turnover				 47.15 vs  36.67</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 1.67 vs   2.45</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    8.03 vs   6.15</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		5.34 vs   3.90</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	     3.23 vs   4.18</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  6.91 vs  11.28</p>
<p>    Tax					 4.08 vs   4.16</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		     0.19 vs   0.19</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (gain)		0.24 vs   0.97</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Hotel Grand Central Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
